b9247710 (2066 1792622640104 "guenchi" (("w5vbequy" . 14982)) (put ((kind . section) (title . "landing f313p3b") (src . "channel, working: the review channel as used: cuts as sets, the scope's own home, sources classified, pieces mapped by the commit\n\nThe first real reviews through the channel found what the fixtures had not. A whole-tree scope\nof a freeze compared the cut as text, and the freeze lists its writers in another order: cuts are\nnow compared as sets. The reviewer could not write its verdict, since every write registers in\nthe machine-wide registry outside its sandbox: scope and collect take --home, and the scoped store\nlives under its own home beside it, so the reviewer writes with that home and nothing reaches the\ncaller's. A verdict citing a before or a packet section was refused: those count as the scope's\nown blocks and are ignored, at least one candidate copy still required. A frozen new file's copy\nis now built by the landing's own construction, one copy per piece, and the commit's answer names\neach piece's committed id (pieces, beside created, fresh and on a replay), so a finding or a\nproposal on a piece maps to the same block whatever moves after the landing.\n") (parent . root) (ord . 437))))
